# APP_OpenMenu
# Opens the app menu: a card window on APP_MENU, listing layouts marked ShowInMenu and not removed.
Set Error Capture [ On ]
New Window [ Style: Card ; Using layout: "APP_MENU" ; Height: 600 ; Width: 360 ; Close: Yes ; Dim parent window: Yes ]
Enter Find Mode [ Pause: Off ]
Set Field [ APP_LAYOUTS::ShowInMenu ; 1 ]
Set Field [ APP_LAYOUTS::RemovedTimestamp ; "=" ]
Perform Find [ ]
Sort Records [ Restore ; With dialog: Off ]
Go to Record/Request/Page [ First ]
